cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data cube it produces, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ASAL causal data cube pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline that builds a monthly, 0.05 degree climate and vegetation
  data cube for the 23 Arid and Semi-Arid Land counties of Kenya from CHIRPS,
  ERA5-Land, MODIS NDVI, the Nino 3.4 anomaly and the Dipole Mode Index, masked to
  the county polygons and annotated with a driver, mediator and response ordering.
